# Error boundaries and source maps

**Prerequisites:** [Diagnostics](/docs/reference/diagnostics/).
**Kind:** concept.
**Next:** [Troubleshooting](/docs/troubleshooting/).

| Phase | Typical command | What to trust |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Rocci parse / lower | `rocci build` / `inspect` | Template diagnostics and source maps |
| Roc compile | `roc` after lowering | Mapped frames when segments exist |
| Application effects | `@init` / handlers | Process exit or HTTP 500 |
| HTTP dispatch | wrong method or path | `--log-handlers` |
| Webview | window does not open | `--no-window` then a browser |

Rocci does not yet publish stable diagnostic codes. Quote the leading message.
`@on` rewrites are migrations, not deprecation warnings.

**Related:** [Develop and inspect](/docs/how-to/develop-and-inspect/).
